1
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:12,960
Mr. Wang, Mr. Qin.

2
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,680
Why don't you listen to this?

3
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,080
Back when we were in the group,

4
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,120
about you making me take the faulty elevator,

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,720
don't you think you owe me an explanation?

6
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,400
At the time,

7
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,720
I really didn't know that elevator would plunge.

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,800
If you're truly grateful to me,

9
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,080
then tell Mr. Qin,

10
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,000
tell him that 'Sweet Strike' was written by me.

11
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,200
Convince him to hand the upcoming projects over to me as well.

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,960
There's only room for one at the top, and that's me.

13
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:38,519
As for you,

14
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,920
you're not even worthy of carrying my shoes.

15
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,120
Qi Miao.

16
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,080
Mr. Jiang.

17
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,280
You brought this on yourself.

18
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,360
Why did you call me here in such a hurry?

19
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,240
Honey,

20
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,440
I'm pregnant.

21
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,560
We're about to have a baby.

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,760
What did you just say?

23
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,640
What's wrong?

24
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,240
This is... this is so unexpected.

25
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,400
Aren't you happy that I'm pregnant?

26
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:06,800
Shanshan,

27
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,040
you know,

28
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,520
this isn't the right time.

29
00:01:10,279 --> 00:01:11,320
Let's terminate the pregnancy.

30
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,600
No, I won't.

31
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,000
It's okay.

32
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,120
I'll wait for you.

33
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,920
I'll work hard to make sure our company's resources

34
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,280
are all under my control.

35
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,680
When the time is right,

36
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,440
you can divorce her.

37
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:26,480
Shanshan,

38
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,800
trust me.

39
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:28,920
After we get married,

40
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,480
we'll have children.

41
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,920
Believe me.

42
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,800
Mr. Jiang,

43
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,360
this money

44
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,760
should be enough to support you for a while.

45
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,400
Are you trying to send me away?

46
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,200
Do you think you can still stay here after this happened?

47
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,600
Can you really bear staying here?

48
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,240
Are you that afraid of your father-in-law?

49
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,360
If worse comes to worst,

50
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,040
we can just give up the company.

51
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,079
Darling,

52
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,120
let's get married.

53
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,600
We can start over.

54
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:18,040
And besides, I’m already pregnant.

55
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,800
I told you,

56
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,240
terminate the pregnancy.

57
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,280
No,

58
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,280
I won't do it.

59
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,760
This is our child.

60
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,120
Are you out of your mind?

61
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,000
Jiang Shan,

62
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,960
everything that's happened is your fault.

63
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,640
If you want to blame someone, blame yourself.

64
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,120
Let’s not see each other again.

65
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,280
Wang Qiankun,

66
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,120
let me tell you this:

67
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:39,120
I will never terminate this pregnancy, even if I die.

68
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,400
If worse comes to worst,

69
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,320
we'll go down together.

70
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,080
Jiang Shan,

71
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,200
we've known each other for so long.

72
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,880
It’s no good for anyone if we make things ugly.

73
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,320
You’re a smart person,

74
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,040
don’t make me spell it out.

75
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,400
Wang Qiankun,

76
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,880
let me ask you,

77
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,280
did you ever truly love me?

78
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,440
Are you insane?

79
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:28,200
Teacher Jiang,

80
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,520
what are you doing here?

81
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,520
Teacher Jiang,

82
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:43,720
I really didn’t know there were recordings behind this.

83
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,960
Are you satisfied now?

84
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,320
I...

85
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,640
I really didn’t know it would turn out like this.

86
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:53,400
Enough!

87
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,200
Qi Miao,

88
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,520
let me warn you:

89
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,760
don’t think you can laugh at me.

90
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,720
You’ve already been lucky enough.

91
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,560
Why do you still want to ruin me?

92
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,640
I never meant to ruin you, Teacher Jiang!

93
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,480
Get out!

94
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,400
I don't want to see you!

95
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,200
Ms. Jiang.

96
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,240
Get out!

97
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,560
Get out!

98
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:19,720
Get out!

99
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:21,880
Get out!

100
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,119
Get out!

101
00:04:25,999 --> 00:04:26,840
Qi Miao.

102
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,160
I won't let you get away with this.

103
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:42,440
I didn't expect yesterday's incident to blow up like this.

104
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,160
When you make a mistake,

105
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,520
you have to face the consequences.

106
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,480
The way she ended up like this,

107
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,640
it's all her own doing, step by step.

108
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,640
About that recording yesterday,

109
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,400
even if you hadn't released it,

110
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,080
she would have eventually faced an even worse fate.

111
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,040
So,

112
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,320
there's no need for you to feel guilty over their mistakes.

113
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:04,240
Actually, when Jiang Shan said I was lucky yesterday,

114
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,920
even I was a little surprised.

115
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,640
Living a happy life,

116
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,840
having a smooth career,

117
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,280
and having you by my side,

118
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,600
it all feels like a dream.

119
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,800
Do you still think

120
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,440
this is a dream?

121
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:32,760
What are you doing?

122
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,760
I'm feeling down here.

123
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:35,600
Then,

124
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,280
from now on, whenever you're upset,

125
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,280
I won't kiss you anymore.

126
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:39,880
No way.

127
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:40,800
I can't let you kiss me for nothing.

128
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,680
I have to kiss you back.

129
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,080
I refuse!

130
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,840
Come back here!

131
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,400
Alright, alright.

132
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,080
Are you hungry?

133
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,440
There's food up ahead.

134
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,680
I'll go buy some for you.

135
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,720
Qi Miao.

136
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:38,840
Qi Miao.

137
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,000
You forced me to do this.

138
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,440
You forced me to do this.

139
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,760
Stay away! Stay away from me!

140
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:53,640
Let go of me!

141
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,600
Let go of me!

142
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,240
Let go of me!

143
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,240
No!

144
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,400
Don't hurt her!

145
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,080
Qi Miao!

146
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,240
You'll be okay!

147
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,880
You'll be fine!

148
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,000
As long as I'm here, you'll be okay!

149
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:23,800
I know...

150
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,240
You're my lucky star.

151
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,360
Hao Ruichi!

152
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,600
How's Miaomiao?

153
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,800
That bastard!

154
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,280
I'm going to settle this with her!

155
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:12,240
I'll go with you.

156
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:12,840
Alright.

157
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,680
No one is leaving!

158
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,120
Brother-in-law!

159
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:20,800
Doctor...

160
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,080
How's my sister?

161
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,560
The situation is very serious.

162
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,040
We've managed to stabilize her vital signs for now.

163
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,480
But the patient is still unconscious.

164
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,040
When will she wake up?

165
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,640
I can't say for sure.

166
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,600
It depends on the patient's will to survive.

167
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,760
Take care of your sister.

168
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,320
Stay away! Stay away from me!

169
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,160
Get away from me! Go away!

170
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,240
I know you're not human!

171
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:30,560
Don't come near me!

172
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,200
She's so pure and kind-hearted.

173
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,720
Why would you hurt her?

174
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,160
I was wrong...

175
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,880
I'm pregnant!

176
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,480
I'm carrying a child!

177
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,000
Please, spare me!

178
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,360
From now on...

179
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,840
If you ever appear in front of her again,

180
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,880
I'll make sure you wish you were dead!

181
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,960
I'll turn myself in.

182
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,280
I promise I'll turn myself in.

183
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,640
You should go and rest.

184
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,000
I'll stay and take care of Miaomiao.

185
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:48,960
No need.

186
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,840
Where's Dongdong?

187
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:59,080
He went to handle the discharge paperwork for Qi Miao.

188
00:10:59,160 --> 00:10:59,920
Discharge?

189
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,440
Are you crazy? Discharging her now?

190
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,680
Qi Miao!

191
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:05,960
I'm taking you home.

192
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,280
I know what you're trying to do,

193
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:13,440
but if you do that,

194
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:14,800
you'll die.

195
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,680
If she's not here,

196
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,040
I can't live either.

197
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,400
Hao Ruichi!

198
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:26,960
Step aside!
